\fB\-\:config\fR \fIPATH\fR
T}	T{
The data plane\(aqs configuration file,\: which operators may then edit through the GUI,\: and which the log view reads paths from. Empty disables editing and the log view.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:users\fR \fIPATH\fR
T}	T{
Users file. Default \fB/\:etc/\:xproxy/\:admin\-\:users\fR.
T}
