T}	T{
Server certificate and key,\: PEM. They go together.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:client\-\:ca\fR \fIPATH\fR
T}	T{
Require a client certificate from this CA;\: its common name is the user. Needs \fB\-\:tls\-\:cert\fR.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:restart\-\:cmd\fR \fICOMMAND\fR
T}	T{
Command behind the restart action,\: split on spaces and run \fBwithout a shell\fR. Empty disables the action.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:session\-\:idle\fR \fIDURATION\fR
T}	T{
Session idle timeout. Default 30m.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:session\-\:max\fR \fIDURATION\fR
T}	T{
Session absolute lifetime. Default 12h.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:oidc\-\:issuer\fR \fIURL\fR
T}	T{
OpenID Connect issuer;\: setting it enables single sign\-on.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:oidc\-\:client\-\:id\fR,\: \fB\-\:oidc\-\:client\-\:secret\-\:file\fR
T}	T{
The client registration.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:oidc\-\:external\-\:url\fR \fIURL\fR
T}	T{
Address users reach the GUI at,\: for the redirect URI. Default: taken from the request.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:oidc\-\:ca\fR \fIPATH\fR
T}	T{
CA that signs the provider\(aqs certificate. Default: the system pool.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:oidc\-\:scopes\fR \fILIST\fR
T}	T{
Scopes requested,\: comma separated. Default \fBopenid,\:profile,\:email\fR.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:oidc\-\:user\-\:claim\fR,\: \fB\-\:oidc\-\:role\-\:claim\fR
T}	T{
Which claims name the user and carry the role. Defaults \fBemail\fR and \fBgroups\fR.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:oidc\-\:operators\fR,\: \fB\-\:oidc\-\:viewers\fR \fILIST\fR
T}	T{
Role claim values granting each role,\: comma separated. \fB*\fR in \fB\-\:oidc\-\:viewers\fR accepts every authenticated user.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:validate\fR
T}	T{
Check the options,\: the users file,\: the certificates,\: the configuration file and the restart command,\: print what was found,\: and exit without binding anything.
T}
